{
    "title": "CastChat - Match & Voice Chat",
    "description": "<b>To get connected, match, and talk with your friends from mobile games, this is the Best Free Online Voice Chat app for you to hang out, discuss together, and have fun chatting with AI friends and pets!</b>\r\n\r\nCastChat, Match & Voice Chat, is your fun playhouse and reliable choice to meet like-minded friends, call up online game teammates, enjoy voice chat with real people or AI friends, and play with AI-powered electronic pets.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice Chat and Meet New Friends with CastChat\r\nWith this voice chat app, your gaming experience will be greatly improved! CastChat offers a convenient way to match and find like-minded friends. With just one click, you can match with new friends online from most games to play and voice chat together! \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd73 Chat with Your AI Friends in CastChat app\r\nYour AI friend is typing! AI Friends can be your most loyal voice chat listeners, always available online and ready to respond in CastChat. Even more, you can customize the characteristics of your AI Friends, ensuring that you find the ideal friend and listener who can support you through challenging times and enjoy a cool voice chat.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc36 Play with AI Pets of CastChat\r\nEnjoy the idle relaxing pet game in CastChat! It\u2019s perfect for tycoon game or animal restaurant game lovers to relieve stress and spend idle time. CastChat also empowers every cool pet to talk with you. They will play and voice chat with you in the fun role of Math Solver, History Know-it-all, Storyteller, Linguist, Poet, Chef, and so on. \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd70 Don't miss the fun CastChat mini-games\r\nMake your communication and voice chat more interesting and try new voice chat room mini-game features! Our mini-game center allows you to play mini-games with your friends online at the same time, such as playing Guess What, Spot the Differences game together. Have fun and relax in this voice chat playhouse!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Build Your Own Voice Chat Game Lobby on CastChat\r\nCome to create your dream game team here on CastChat and meet amazing worldwide game players. Find the fun among us! Whether the game you like is popular or niche, you can interact with online friends in real-time, voice chat, and communicate more at this playhouse! \r\n\r\n\u2728 Key Features \u2728\r\n- One-click to start a voice chat, matching, and communicating with new people or your friends\r\n- Real-time chat and quick response\r\n- Chat with AI Friend, the loyal listener who supports voice chat and accompanies you at all time\r\n- Chat with AI Pet, from which you can get voice chat and fun\r\n- Voice Chat with friends on the same channel in CastChat\r\n- Get verified and build your own voice chat playhouse on CastChat\r\n- Collect gifted pets and have fun in an idle relaxing game\r\n- Play fun mini-games in the voice chat playhouse with your friends\r\n\r\n*You can use this app to communicate and keep in touch with your friends from mobile games, but please don't reveal any personal information.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://among.chat/policy.html\r\nTerms of Use: https://among.chat/term.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>To get connected, match, and talk with your friends from mobile games, this is the Best Free Online Voice Chat app for you to hang out, discuss together, and have fun chatting with AI friends and pets!</b><br><br>CastChat, Match &amp; Voice Chat, is your fun playhouse and reliable choice to meet like-minded friends, call up online game teammates, enjoy voice chat with real people or AI friends, and play with AI-powered electronic pets.<br><br>\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice Chat and Meet New Friends with CastChat<br>With this voice chat app, your gaming experience will be greatly improved! CastChat offers a convenient way to match and find like-minded friends. With just one click, you can match with new friends online from most games to play and voice chat together! <br><br>\ud83e\udd73 Chat with Your AI Friends in CastChat app<br>Your AI friend is typing! AI Friends can be your most loyal voice chat listeners, always available online and ready to respond in CastChat. Even more, you can customize the characteristics of your AI Friends, ensuring that you find the ideal friend and listener who can support you through challenging times and enjoy a cool voice chat.<br><br>\ud83d\udc36 Play with AI Pets of CastChat<br>Enjoy the idle relaxing pet game in CastChat! It\u2019s perfect for tycoon game or animal restaurant game lovers to relieve stress and spend idle time. CastChat also empowers every cool pet to talk with you. They will play and voice chat with you in the fun role of Math Solver, History Know-it-all, Storyteller, Linguist, Poet, Chef, and so on. <br><br>\ud83e\udd70 Don&#39;t miss the fun CastChat mini-games<br>Make your communication and voice chat more interesting and try new voice chat room mini-game features! Our mini-game center allows you to play mini-games with your friends online at the same time, such as playing Guess What, Spot the Differences game together. Have fun and relax in this voice chat playhouse!<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Bui